<h2>4. Approval and subsequent adjustments</h2><p>Current specimen status: Unaudited sandbox illustration. No auditor opinion, director approval, regulatory submission or legal certification is implied. Authorized close/reopen and late adjustment workflows own those decisions. Generating a PDF cannot lock a period, resolve a reconciliation break or post an accounting entry.</p><h2>Referenced records</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Snapshot</th><th scope="col">Version</th></tr></thead><tbody><#list facts.sources as row><tr><td>${row.resourceReference}</td><td>${row.version}</td></tr></#list></tbody></table>
